{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared tool catalogue. One source of truth for the tool list so the",
    "PowerShell menus, the WinUI GUI and the Linux Python app cannot drift",
    "apart. Order here is menu order; numbering is assigned per platform",
    "after filtering, so it stays sequential with no gaps.",
    "",
    "platforms       -- which OS shows the entry",
    "needsMutableOS  -- hidden on image-based systems (Silverblue, Bazzite,",
    "                   Kinoite, MicroOS): /usr is read-only and the",
    "                   bootloader belongs to the deployment",
    "powershellScript -- path under src/Windows/CLI/tools/ (the PowerShell",
    "                    implementation; it still covers Linux too)",
    "linuxTool       -- tool id in src/Linux/pchealth/tools/"
  ],
  "tools": [
